    "name": "Delivery Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3865680,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/daaf02a61196bb17d8baa5dc9aa300af.poster.avif?t=1753528204\" width=768 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/daaf02a61196bb17d8baa5dc9aa300af.webm?t=1753528204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/daaf02a61196bb17d8baa5dc9aa300af.mp4?t=1753528204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/dca57e77f9ec483cc724485826622ebc.avif?t=1753528204\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delivery Simulator is a fast-paced and detailed courier simulation where you grow your delivery business from scratch in a bustling city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your courier journey, upgrade your motorcycle, purchase new warehouses, assign robot couriers, and build the largest delivery network in the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/4a22474a3d84bde6516caddc417902e4.poster.avif?t=1753528204\" width=768 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/4a22474a3d84bde6516caddc417902e4.webm?t=1753528204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/4a22474a3d84bde6516caddc417902e4.mp4?t=1753528204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/9dc6a0de457e00fae378fb0d61c28289.avif?t=1753528204\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your day by checking incoming orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open new warehouses, organize your deliveries, and set your route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop on your bike or assign tasks to robot couriers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the city traffic at high speed, avoid accidents, and race against time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2026 not everything goes as planned. Some roads are one-way\u2026 and some have no way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/31fe8c413fb3d83aeea6685fee73b595.poster.avif?t=1753528204\" width=768 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/31fe8c413fb3d83aeea6685fee73b595.webm?t=1753528204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/31fe8c413fb3d83aeea6685fee73b595.mp4?t=1753528204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/a8ca6d12fc3290171e2a41c18f53f2e4.avif?t=1753528204\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Expanding Delivery Network: Buy new warehouses and increase your influence across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Multiple Delivery Methods: Deliver using motorcycles, vans, or robot couriers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Realistic Traffic &amp; Risks: A true city experience with accidents, traffic fines, and road rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dynamic Time &amp; Weather: Nights are dangerous, roads are slippery in the rain\u2014deliveries go on no matter what.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Crash &amp; Penalty Mechanics: Speed is good, but it comes at a cost. The more rules you break, the greater the risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Atmospheric World: Immerse yourself in a deep urban vibe with rain, ambient street sounds, and dim city lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/4a307624180ae09773baae3dc624ea42.poster.avif?t=1753528204\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/4a307624180ae09773baae3dc624ea42.webm?t=1753528204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/4a307624180ae09773baae3dc624ea42.mp4?t=1753528204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/7d109c01dd62fa7cdce8e549c1cec992.avif?t=1753528204\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this city, every delivery is a journey, and every turn is a choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll start as a simple courier, but soon become a known name in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember one thing: some deliveries are easy\u2026 others never end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saying \u201cDelivered\u201d doesn\u2019t always mean the job is done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/1dc001553597e64db95420a3ae37a700.avif?t=1753528204\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0New city regions and delivery scenarios</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0Drone delivery feature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0Multiplayer (co-op) game mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0Expanded vehicle and character customization options</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/daaf02a61196bb17d8baa5dc9aa300af.poster.avif?t=1753528204\" width=768 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/daaf02a61196bb17d8baa5dc9aa300af.webm?t=1753528204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/daaf02a61196bb17d8baa5dc9aa300af.mp4?t=1753528204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/dca57e77f9ec483cc724485826622ebc.avif?t=1753528204\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delivery Simulator is a fast-paced and detailed courier simulation where you grow your delivery business from scratch in a bustling city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your courier journey, upgrade your motorcycle, purchase new warehouses, assign robot couriers, and build the largest delivery network in the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/4a22474a3d84bde6516caddc417902e4.poster.avif?t=1753528204\" width=768 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/4a22474a3d84bde6516caddc417902e4.webm?t=1753528204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/4a22474a3d84bde6516caddc417902e4.mp4?t=1753528204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/9dc6a0de457e00fae378fb0d61c28289.avif?t=1753528204\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your day by checking incoming orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open new warehouses, organize your deliveries, and set your route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop on your bike or assign tasks to robot couriers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the city traffic at high speed, avoid accidents, and race against time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2026 not everything goes as planned. Some roads are one-way\u2026 and some have no way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/31fe8c413fb3d83aeea6685fee73b595.poster.avif?t=1753528204\" width=768 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/31fe8c413fb3d83aeea6685fee73b595.webm?t=1753528204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/31fe8c413fb3d83aeea6685fee73b595.mp4?t=1753528204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/a8ca6d12fc3290171e2a41c18f53f2e4.avif?t=1753528204\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Expanding Delivery Network: Buy new warehouses and increase your influence across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Multiple Delivery Methods: Deliver using motorcycles, vans, or robot couriers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Realistic Traffic &amp; Risks: A true city experience with accidents, traffic fines, and road rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dynamic Time &amp; Weather: Nights are dangerous, roads are slippery in the rain\u2014deliveries go on no matter what.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Crash &amp; Penalty Mechanics: Speed is good, but it comes at a cost. The more rules you break, the greater the risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Atmospheric World: Immerse yourself in a deep urban vibe with rain, ambient street sounds, and dim city lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/4a307624180ae09773baae3dc624ea42.poster.avif?t=1753528204\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/4a307624180ae09773baae3dc624ea42.webm?t=1753528204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/4a307624180ae09773baae3dc624ea42.mp4?t=1753528204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/7d109c01dd62fa7cdce8e549c1cec992.avif?t=1753528204\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this city, every delivery is a journey, and every turn is a choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll start as a simple courier, but soon become a known name in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember one thing: some deliveries are easy\u2026 others never end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saying \u201cDelivered\u201d doesn\u2019t always mean the job is done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865680/extras/1dc001553597e64db95420a3ae37a700.avif?t=1753528204\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0New city regions and delivery scenarios</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0Drone delivery feature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0Multiplayer (co-op) game mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0Expanded vehicle and character customization options</p>",
